{"id": "EUVD-2026-82095", "enisaUuid": "665b0920-b837-3644-8bd1-1b67464238ac", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nisofs: release zisofs block pointer buffer head\n\nzisofs_fill_pages() reads the compressed block pointer table.  The error\npaths release the current buffer_head, the loop also releases the old\nbuffer_head when it advances. However, the success path leaves the last\nbuffer_head referenced. Release it before returning success.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:09:53", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:03:39", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dbcc7d1b818162aeab2e97fd217d86546d9fde15", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ec33e6b7a1de20d7e623b12633191a855445657d", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0c2c54a7d174edc845f7bae24179fe72a926d10f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5677737c2cedf417c0fcf61540b9cef0e62273d4", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f2a1611065c700a374b31c5cc8a7587f5e3bfe73", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/106e1a3b2b3454fbda63a59e9290cb9a253f81aa", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3371d30a97a257b7b5f2c8009612e9d452180f0a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2f7dd9b86fe4076059e6a4a2a2c5d565afd76b9e"], "aliases": ["GHSA-xwjp-h426-22vm", "CVE-2026-90434"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0b4bdef6-c8f4-3f88-8684-0c21f3a7c6c0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "2.6.33"}, {"id": "183cca00-c2b5-345a-b3e7-caa04a7ab78d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 5.15.221"}, {"id": "3592ac9b-242a-315a-8e15-ea8e4e04989a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "592a79d8-69e6-3e37-b866-88a20f7f3775", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.157"}, {"id": "620939be-7adf-3970-8a74-85b400e54dc7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "prod